The installed rgpot ships Potentials.capnp.h under include/rgpot/rpc, so the
bare include only resolves inside the rgpot subproject; with_serve against an
installed rgpot fails. Same fix as TheochemUI/eOn develop.
author: Rohit Goswami (SURF)
--- a/client/ServeRpcServer.cpp
+++ b/client/ServeRpcServer.cpp
@@ -34,7 +34,7 @@
 // Cap'n Proto generated header (from Potentials.capnp).
 // This defines `class Potential` -- which collides with eOn's Potential class,
 // hence the separate translation unit.
-#include "Potentials.capnp.h"
+#include "rgpot/rpc/Potentials.capnp.h"
 
 namespace {
 
